        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "A character that runs on your status bar",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>A small animated character runs across your status bar and speeds up as the device gets busier. Frames advance <strong>one at a time</strong> at an interval derived from the current load, so the value maps straight onto how fast it moves.</p><p>Turn it on in <strong>Settings → HomerRun</strong>.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Run speed",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<ul><li><strong>CPU</strong> (default) — follows the processor load; the label shows the usage percentage</li><li><strong>Network</strong> — runs faster as traffic increases; the label shows the transfer rate</li></ul>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<ul><li>Long press for details — CPU, memory, battery, storage, and network in one panel</li><li>Swap the character: drop a folder of frames in and it appears in the list</li><li>Position and size, measured from the top left of the screen</li><li>Label — show or hide it, then set size, color, and font name</li><li>Hidden in landscape; the animation stops while hidden</li><li>English and Japanese, following the device language</li><li>No Cephei and no libcolorpicker — colors use the system color picker</li></ul>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
