        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Info panel",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>Long press the running character and a panel opens in place.</p><ul><li>CPU usage with System / User / Idle</li><li>Memory usage with Active / Wired / Compressed</li><li>Battery level, power source, health, cycle count, temperature</li><li>Storage used and free space</li><li>Wi-Fi or Cellular, local IP, upload and download</li></ul>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
