        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "How to use",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<ol><li>Install HomerRun from this repo, then respring</li><li>Open Settings → HomerRun and enable the switch</li><li>Choose CPU or Network under Run speed</li><li>Set the character, position, size, and label to taste</li></ol><p>To use your own frames, create a folder of frame images inside <code>/var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/Homero.bundle/Gifs</code> and respring. Frames play in filename order, and <strong>Open images folder</strong> jumps there in Filza.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
